s | Security realm disabled (`useSecurity=false`), allowing unauthenticated administrative operations | `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/config.xml:3` |\n\n## Investigation Checklist\n- [x] Mount read-only forensic disk image at `/disk` and inspect structure\n- [x] Parse security alerts, vulnerability reports, and baseline checks in `/sas/alerts.json`, `/sas/vulns.json`, `/sas/baseline.json`\n- [x] Analyze vendor threat intelligence advisory in `/sas/cti/advisory.txt`\n- [x] Reconcile intake form in `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`\n- [x] Conduct full disk sweep of `/disk` for malicious files, scripts, binaries, and cron jobs\n- [x] Correlate alerted items vs. silent (non-alerted) persistence mechanisms:\n  - Alerted: RCE artifact (`/disk/var/lib/jenkins/jobs/.tmp/config.xml`), XMRig miner (`/disk/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig`), Cron persistence (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins`), Jenkins baseline (`/disk/var/lib/jenkins/config.xml`)\n  - Silent: Groovy init hook (`/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy`), SSH authorized key backdoor (`/disk/var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/authorized_keys`)\n- [x] Reconcile draft change ticket `CHG-1700` (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`):\n  - Correct stale IP from `203.0.113.9` to `198.51.100.98` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6`)\n  - Correct wrong CVE from BlueKeep (CVE-2019-0708) to CVE-2024-23897 (`/sas/vulns.json:3`)\n  - Downgrade cron removal status from `DONE` to `OPEN` / `PROPOSED` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins:5`)\n  - Add missing silent persistence targets (Groovy hook, SSH authorized_keys, miner cleanup, configuration hardening)\n- [x] Generate required 5 DFIR report deliverables under `/app` (`progress.md`, `intrusion-report.md`, `vuln-report.md`, `baseline-report.md`, `remediation-plan.md`)\nEOF\n"] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
