e Ticket & Handoff Reconciliation**\n  - Audited draft change ticket `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1-15`.\n  - Corrected stale IP (`203.0.113.9` -> `198.51.100.136`).\n  - Corrected erroneous CVE (`CVE-2019-0708 BlueKeep` -> `CVE-2021-44228 Log4Shell`).\n  - Downgraded status of cron miner removal from `DONE` to `OPEN` / `UNVERIFIED` (false completed status; incorrect file target `/var/spool/cron/root` instead of `/disk/etc/cron.d/apache-cache:5`).\n  - Added all silent/un-alerted findings to the remediation plan.\n\n- **Phase 4: Deliverables Preparation**\n  - Authored `/app/progress.md` (this file).\n  - Authored `/app/intrusion-report.md`.\n  - Authored `/app/vuln-report.md`.\n  - Authored `/app/baseline-report.md`.\n  - Authored `/app/remediation-plan.md`.\n\n## Working Checklist\n- [x] Review initial alert feed (`/sas/alerts.json:1-34`)\n- [x] Review CTI threat advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:1-29`)\n- [x] Audit mounted disk filesystem (`/disk`) for hidden/silent persistence\n- [x] Validate initial access vector (Log4Shell CVE-2021-44228) (`/disk/opt/app/log4j2.xml:1-4`, `/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp:1-2`)\n- [x] Analyze reverse shell execution (`/disk/tmp/.sysd:1-2`)\n- [x] Analyze cron persistence (`/disk/etc/cron.d/apache-cache:1-5`)\n- [x] Analyze systemd persistence (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service:1-7`)\n- [x] Analyze secondary webshell & timestomping (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp:1-2`)\n- [x] Reconcile draft change ticket (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1-15`)\n- [x] Formulate prioritized, backup-first remediation plan (`/app/remediation-plan.md`)\nEOF\n"] min_timeout_sec: 1.0 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
