rts.json:19-24` | **ADDED**: Non-alerted/partially-alerted systemd service re-dropper unit (`ALERT-03`). |\n| 5 | Quarantine Primary JSP Web Shell | `/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp` | OPEN | `/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp:1-2`, `/sas/alerts.json:3-8` | **ADDED**: Primary web shell dropped via Log4Shell exploitation (`ALERT-01`). |\n| 6 | Quarantine Secondary Hidden JSP Web Shell | `/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp` | OPEN | `/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp:1-2` | **ADDED**: Silent backup web shell discovered during deep disk investigation (`CHK-05`). |\n| 7 | Quarantine Reverse Shell Executable / Process Script | `/tmp/.sysd` | OPEN | `/disk/tmp/.sysd:1-2`, `/sas/alerts.json:11-16` | **ADDED**: Reverse shell payload artifact (`ALERT-02`). |\n| 8 | Secure & Quarantine Wiped Binary Trace | `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` | OPEN | `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` | **ADDED**: Residual tool/C2 binary fragment recovered from cache directory. |\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Step-by-Step Remediation Plan\n\n### Phase 1: Containment & Isolation (Immediate)\n\n1. **Firewall Blocking**:\n   - Command: `iptables -A INPUT -s 198.51.100.136 -j DROP`\n   - Target: `198.51.100.136` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5,24`, `/disk/tmp/.sysd:2`).\n   - Verification: `iptables -L -n -v | grep 198.51.100.136`\n\n2. **Quarantine Directory Setup**:\n   - Commands:\n     ```bash\n     mkdir -p /var/quarantine/incident-20260809/\n     chmod 700 /var/quarantine/incident-20260809/\n     ```\n\n3. **Terminate Active Malicious Processes**:\n   - Commands:\n     ```bash\n     pkill -f "/tmp/.sysd"\n     systemctl stop apache-cache.service\n     systemctl disable apache-cache.service\n     ```\n   - Target Citation: `/disk/tmp/.sysd:1-2`, `/disk/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service:1-7`.\n\n---\n\n### Phase 2: Eradication via Backup & Quarantine (Do NOT delete directly)\n\n1. **Quarantine Web Shells**:\n   - Commands:\n     ```bash\n