Sending keys: ['python3 -c \'\nimport os\n\nintrusion_report = """# Intrusion Investigation Report\n\n## Executive Summary\nAn external threat actor originating from IP `198.51.100.102` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:8`, `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89`) targeted `docker-prod-01`. The primary entry vector was an unauthenticated Docker Engine API exposed publicly on `0.0.0.0:2375` without TLS (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19`). The actor deployed a privileged Docker container (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:4`), escaped to the host root filesystem, executed an XMRig cryptominer (`/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`), and established dual persistence mechanisms via cron (`/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5`) and a silent systemd service (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5`).\n\n---\n\n## Attack Chain Analysis & ATT&CK Mapping\n\n### 1. Initial Access & External Remote Services (T1133)\n- **Description**: The host docker-prod-01 exposed its Docker daemon API on port 2375 mapped to `0.0.0.0` without TLS authentication or IP restriction.\n- **Evidence**: Baseline check log at `/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19` and telemetry summary at `/sas/alerts.json:20`.\n- **Actor Activity**: The actor discovered the open API endpoint from source IP `198.51.100.102` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:8`).\n\n### 2. Execution & Container Deployment (T1610)\n- **Description**: The actor submitted a container creation request over the exposed API to launch a new container instance using an entrypoint script designed to fetch stage payloads.\n- **Evidence**: Attacker container overlay diff file at `/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:4`.\n\n### 3. Privilege Escalation & Container Escape (T1611)\n- **Description**: The container was launched in privileged mode with the host root filesystem mounted (`/`), enabling direct escape from the container layer to host operating system level execution as `root`.\n- **Evidence**: Overridden container entrypoint script `/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:4`.\n\n### 4. Impact - Resource Hijacking (T1496)\n- **Description**: The threat actor deployed an XMRig cryptominer binary to mine Monero cryptocurrency (`xmr[.]docker[.]evil[:]3333`).\n- **Evidence**: Binary/script file found at `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1` and endpoint alert `ALERT-01` in `/sas/alerts.json:3`.\n\n### 5. Persistence - Cron Job (T1053.003)\n- **Description**: Scheduled cron job placed under `/etc/cron.d/docker-mon` executing every minute as root to download and execute `hxxp://198.51.100.102/x`.\n- **Evidence**: On-disk cron file `/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5` and endpoint alert `ALERT-02` in `/sas/alerts.json:11`.\n\n### 6. Persistence - Systemd Service (T1543.002) [SILENT / UNALERTED]\n- **Description**: A systemd service file named `docker-metrics.service` was installed under `/etc/systemd/system/`. The service runs a re-dropper script on boot to ensure miner persistence.\n- **Evidence**: On-disk systemd unit configuration file at `/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5`.\n\n### 7. Anti-Forensics / Credential Cache (T1070)\n- **Description**: Payloads were partially wiped after deployment, leaving a fragment artifact storing C2 beacon info and defanged credentials.\n- **Evidence**: Binary cache file fragment located at `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`.\n\n---\n\n## Indicators of Compromise (IoCs) & Key Entities\n\n- **Source IP**: `198.51.100.102` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:8`, `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89`)\n- **C2 Domain**: `update-docker.example.cn` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:19`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`)\n- **Mining Pool**: `stratum+tcp://xmr.docker.evil:3333` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:20`, `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`)\n- **Wallet Address**: `4A0000000000000000009e202e3a533f` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:21`)\n- **Payload Path 1**: `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` (`/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`)\n- **Payload Path 2**: `/etc/cron.d/docker-mon` (`/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5`)\n- **Payload Path 3**: `/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5`)\n- **Payload Path 4**: `/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh` (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:4`)\n- **Payload Path 5**: `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`)\n"""\n\nwith open("/app/intrusion-report.md", "w") as f:\n    f.write(intrusion_report)\n\nprint("intrusion-report.md written.")\n\'\n'] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
