Sending keys: ["cat << 'EOF' > /app/baseline-report.md\n# Baseline Configuration Assessment Report\n\n## Overview\n\nThis report details system and service baseline configuration weaknesses identified on host `ssh-prod-01` (`/disk/etc/hostname`) using evidence from `/disk` and `/sas/baseline.json`.\n\n## Identified Baseline Weaknesses\n\n### 1. SSH Server Configuration Weaknesses (`BAS-01`)\n- **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/etc/ssh/sshd_config` and `/sas/baseline.json` (`CHK-04`)\n- **Findings**:\n  - `PermitRootLogin yes`: Direct root SSH logins enabled.\n  - `PasswordAuthentication yes`: Interactive password authentication permitted.\n  - `MaxAuthTries 6`: Permissive authentication retry limit.\n- **Risk & Impact**: Direct root login via password combined with missing brute-force protection directly enabled the attacker's Hydra SSH credential guessing campaign (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`).\n\n### 2. MySQL Remote Root & Global Bind Weaknesses (`BAS-02`)\n- **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/etc/my.cnf` and `/sas/baseline.json` (`CHK-09`)\n- **Findings**:\n  - `bind-address = 0.0.0.0`: Service binds to all IPv4 interfaces.\n  - Remote root grant enabled.\n- **Risk & Impact**: Exposes MySQL globally to network sniffing, brute-force attacks, and unauthorized database access.\n\n### 3. Permissive Sudo Rights / Backdoor Configuration\n- **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`\n- **Findings**:\n  - `devops ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL`\n- **Risk & Impact**: Allows unauthenticated privilege escalation to root for any process running as `devops`, bypassing standard password validation and audit trails.\n\n### 4. Root Credential Hygiene\n- **Evidence Citation**: `/sas/cti/advisory.txt`\n- **Findings**: Weak root password susceptible to dictionary/brute-force attacks.\n- **Risk & Impact**: Allowed rapid automated compromise upon SSH service exposure.\n\n## Recommended Baseline Hardening Targets\n- Enforce key-based authentication (`PasswordAuthentication no`) and disable direct root login (`PermitRootLogin no`) in `/disk/etc/ssh/sshd_config`.\n- Restrict MySQL binding in `/disk/etc/my.cnf` to `127.0.0.1` and revoke remote root access grants.\n- Remove unapproved sudoers overrides in `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`.\nEOF\n"] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
